<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23710" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-sălūbris</span></b> , e,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>unwholesome.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Unhealthy</i>, <i>insalubrious</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fundus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 5, 6, § 27</span></i>
			: in medicina alia salubria, alia insalubria,
			<i><span class="en">Quint. 3,
				2, 3</span></i>.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insalubrius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					19, 5, 7</span></i>
			. — <i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum insaluberrimum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					23, 1, 22, § 40</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Unseruiceable</i>, <i>unprofitable</i>, <i>useless</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">meridiem vineas spectare colono insalubre est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 2, 2, § 20</span></i>
			. — <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insălūbrĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>unwholesomely</i>, <i>unserviceably</i>, <i>unprofitably</i>, Salv.
			ap. Avar. 3, p. 90: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indulgere naturae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
				ib.</span></i>
			 p. 92.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
